    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIdeally situated in the highly sought-after Milltown Gate Estate in Blessington and looking out onto a beautiful green area, \nNo. 46 Milltown Gate comes to the market in excellent condition throughout with the benefit of no onward chain attached to the sale.From the moment you turn onto this peaceful cul de sac of only nine houses, you know you're not about to enter your average three bedroom semi-detached home.The spacious living room, with beautifully decorated panelling is located to the right of the entrance hallway and in turn, opens through double doors into a fully equipped open plan kitchen/dining area.Back through the hallway, there is a guest WC located just off the kitchen along with storage space. The stairs then takes us up to the first floor accommodation.This comprises of three generously sized bedrooms. The primary bedroom is ensuite and comes with panelling. The main bathroom completes the upstairs accommodation.This property also majorly benefits from an attic extension which includes a fully fitted bathroom. To the rear of the property is a sun-trapped, maintenance-free haven - ideal for these long, summer evenings!Milltown Gate has long been considered Blessington's most desirable development and lies just outside Blessington Village, meaning all amenities - shops, churches, schools, pubs and restaurants are all within walking distance, while the Town Centre development, which includes Dunnes Stores and various other retail and leisure outlets are on your doorstep.Blessington is a beautiful country town, yet is only 18 miles from Dublin city, which is easily accessed through the regular Dublin Bus service (No. 65). Schools, buses and childcare facilities are all on your doorstep. Blessington Greenway, as well as the famous Blessington lakes are also easily accessible. The town has 4 Primary Schools, 1 secondary school and Feeder buses to several Kildare and Dublin private secondary schools.Call or email now for viewing details."
